source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A plain line below a marker is content of the item above it rather than a new block; jiro keeps it in the item, and the physical break becomes a space as it does in a paragraph.
-- input.jira --
* a
foo
-- rendered.html --
<ul>
	<li>a<br/>
foo</li>
</ul>
-- want.md --
- a foo
-- warnings.json --
[]
